What was absorbed
------------------

The 28 `skills/seedance-*` sub-skills, their supporting `references/*.md`
files (including `references/vocab/*.md`), and the `schemas/*.json` files
from the above commit were adapted into media-forge's `skills/mf-*` family
(see `skills/` for the current names) and rebranded for media-forge's
multi-provider scope (Veo, Kling, Higgsfield, Seedance). Two of the upstream
skills (`seedance-copyright` and `seedance-filter`) were merged into a single
`mf-safety-rewrite` skill; one upstream skill (`seedance-prompting`) was
superseded and removed. Descriptions, cross-references, and file names were
rewritten; provider-specific guidance was preserved and marked as such inline
rather than deleted. No content from `references/migrated/v5.2-legacy-skill-bodies/`
was absorbed.

